# v46 priorities from the v45 report:
# 1-3 P30: accept/reject mask-equivalence appendix, freeze predeclared patch protocol, and require a fresh rerun under frozen protocol.
# 4-5 P36: publication audit appendix + blinded unit-conversion stress.
# 6 P41: real q2 likelihood table consumer.
# 7 P33: measured BAO alpha split consumer.
# 8 P32: stronger GWOSC endpoint resolution/product gate.
# 9 SMD: external pre-registered prediction metadata/residual sigma.
# 10 Dashboard: explicit three confirmation buckets.

